This module is divided into two different blocks:

  7.1 Create (current script) | Creates an ImageCollection of Landsat scenes and runs CCDC. Results are stored as an asset
      This includes also the calculation of the NDFI Index - Normalized Degradation Fraction Index (NDFI; Souza et al., 2005) | Spectrally unmixed data.
